Scope

This license covers the tool source code, tests and documentation in this
repository. It does not cover, and this repository does not contain, any part
of EARTH DEFENSE FORCE 6: shader bytecode, SGO / CPK files and anything derived
from them stay on each user's own machine.

edf6shader/cpk.py and edf6shader/crilayla.py are adapted from momotori01's
EDF6MultiSlot and remain under the Unlicense; see edf6shader/LICENSE.edf6-cpk.
